    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Team:</strong> Hjumpik + Toad Lee.</p><p>Hjumpik lifts Toad Lee while Toad Lee chops through the growth ahead. Both characters spend 1 Bros Energy. Use an action, resolve the clearing, and move the pair up to the distance opened by the table.</p><p><strong>Resource:</strong> Each character has 2 Bros Energy. All spent energy returns after a very short rest.</p><p><strong>Safety:</strong> Do not use a countdown. Keep the axe arc clear. Stop if the lift becomes unsafe.</p>",
      "chat": "<p>Shared rhythm, no countdown. Both partners spend 1 Bros Energy.</p>"
    },
